|YKBThe Charlatan's Guild|000

Charlatans are wanderers by nature. Although not exclusive to the
gypsies, the guild is greatly influenced by that race of wanderers. 
Many of the core ideas and abilities held by the Charlatans can find 
their origins in the history of the Gypsy.

This wandering spirit has forced them to adopt "creative" means for 
earning a living. All charlatans are intelligent and charismatic, and
have some knowledge of the living anatomy and brewing of potions to
affect the anatomy. Some choose to focus their skills and energy on
using this knowledge along with illusion and slight of hand to gain
the upper hand in their dealings with those around them. Others focus
their skills more on the brewing of potions and how they affect the
body to gain an unfair advantage over their opponent.

There are no specific guild levels within Charlatan. You must earn
skill training points to learn and advance each individual skill 
that is available. You will begin with a few to begin your journies,
but you must gain experience and return to the guild in order to 
aquire more training points. 

There are some abilities common to every charlatan. However, a
charlatan's focus will determine how effective he or she will be at 
a given skill.

You will begin with 5 skill training points. Use them wisely to
learn and/or advance a particular skill. Once you gain enough
experience, you may advance in the guild hall and aquire more skill
training points.

Use '|GKBchelp illusion|alchemy|000' for more info on each focus.
Use '|GKBchelp commands|000' for a list of commands.

